{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795127681197,"sessionID":"ses_e0a0e9139ffeueffAzFzUVtP7e","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-a1f9fafd831f189d","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /travail && .venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nimport pymupdf as fitz, glob, os\nfor f in sorted(glob.glob('test/*.pdf')):\n d=fitz.open(f)\n print('='*35,os.path.basename(f),'pages',len(d))\n print(d[0].get_text()[:1200].replace('\\n',' | '))\nEOF"},"output":"=================================== doc-004.pdf pages 4\nVEXITIK SERVICES LTD | Printed on 28 Mar 2026 | sheet 1/4 | Report VS-RI-2026-6396 | TECHNICAL INTERVENTION REPORT | Report reference : VS-RI-2026-6396 | Supersedes : VS-RI-2026-6021 | PO number : PO-879116 | Job no. : AFF-86877 | Customer : Mirlor Foods, Head office: Telford | Installation : Line 1, rotary filling machine | Equipment : Ulvorgen 600 | Manufacturer : | Serial number : FE836339 | Asset no. : INV-98493 | Request date : 10 Mar 2026 | Issue date : 23 Mar 2026 | Date of intervention : 22 Mar 2026 | The customer was briefed on the points of attention noted during the visit. Operators reported short stoppages at shift start, with no | alarm message. Demineralised water at room temperature was used for all tests. | I. BACKGROUND | Background and equipment | Guide lubrication was topped up as per the manual. Suction filters were removed, rinsed and refitted. The visit concerns the dosing | equipment of line 1. It is driven by a Vergen motor, type T91-4P. Checks were carried out with calibrated instruments; certificates | are available to the customer. The night shift was informed of the adjustments made. | Course of the visit | The work area was cordoned off for the whole duration of the visit. The previous preventive visit o\n=================================== doc-005.pdf pages 4\nVEXITIK SERVICES LTD | Printed on 5 Apr 2025 | sheet 1/4 | Report VS-RI-2025-2049 | TECHNICAL INTERVENTION REPORT | Report reference : VS-RI-2025-2049 | PO number : PO-425523 | Job no. : AFF-70040 | Customer : Vexdal Pharma, Head office: Swindon | Location : Livingston Works | Installation : Line 1, automatic pipette | Manufacturer : Corovane | Serial number : plate missing | Asset no. : INV-72945 | Request date : 14 Mar 2025 | Issue date : 24 Mar 2025 | Date of intervention : n/a | Machine noise level in operation remained as usual. Suction filters were removed, rinsed and refitted. Frame fixings and hoses | were visually inspected; no corrosion was found. | I. BACKGROUND | Background and equipment | The prevention plan was reviewed with the site safety department before work started. No abnormal noise or heating was observed | during dry runs. Dried product residue on the frame was cleaned off. The circuit was purged until a steady flow was obtained. The | visit concerns the automatic pipette Calanquin 160. It is driven by a Varevex motor, type K73-4P. Guide lubrication was topped up | as per the manual. The maintenance history was reviewed in the customer's logbook. | Course of the visit | The electrical cabinet ventilation was d\n=================================== doc-006.pdf pages 3\nRiliovane Services | Rapport n° DI-RI-2026-3776 | Imprimé le 1er octobre 2026 | Page 1/3 | RAPPORT D'INTERVENTION | Maintenance et contrôle métrologique d'un équipement de dosage | Référence du rapport | DI-RI-2026-3776 | N° de commande | CDE-115203 | N° d'affaire | AFF-82591 | Client | Fromageries Rilvane ; Siège : Saumur | Installation | Ligne 2 ; pompe doseuse à membrane | Équipement | — | Constructeur | Vexlix | N° de série | VE/19/3086 | N° d'inventaire | INV-34624 | Date de la demande | 2 septembre 2026 | Date d'émission | 16 septembre 2026 | Date d'intervention | 13 septembre 2026 | Contexte et équipement concerné | La purge du circuit a été réalisée jusqu'à obtention d'un écoulement régulier. L'intervention porte sur la pompe doseuse à | membrane Saruldor 85. Elle est entraînée par un moteur Neveltik de type M100-4P. L'accès à