ved cleaning the fluid\ncircuit.\nTechnician's opinion\nFrame fixings and hoses were visually inspected; no corrosion was found. Cycle\ncounter readings were entered in the machine logbook. Tests were run until\nreadings were stable. The technician checked that no air bubbles were present\nin the circuit before each series of measurements. Guide lubric\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /travail && .venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nimport pymupdf as fitz\nfor stem,name in [('doc-035','Margot'),('doc-040','Hugo'),('doc-044','Ryan')]:\n print('='*25,stem)\n t=\"\\n\".join(p.get_text() for p in fitz.open(f'fourni/{stem}.pdf'))\n i=t.find(name)\n print(t[max(0,i-500):i+400])\nEOF","time":{"start":1795128087903,"end":1795128087995}},"id":"prt_1f5f8d3f9001jXtk0T8KScyv0W","sessionID":"ses_e0a0e9139ffeueffAzFzUVtP7e","messageID":"msg_1f5f8c3230017DLqZWMgpzZ9o4"}}
