nReplacements\nAccess to the machine was granted after electrical and pneumatic lock-out by the line manager. No abnormal noise or\nheating was observed during dry runs. Part OS-506-E (tip cone) was inspected and found in good condition. The\ntechnician checked that no air bubbles were present in the circuit before each series of measurements. Machine noise\nlevel in operation remained as usual.\nField team\nDried product residue on the frame was cleaned off. Cleaning-in-place instructions were reminded to the production\nteam. Grace Calloway led the visit with the support of Rhys Ashby, at the request of Hannah Thornley.\n\n---page 3\nZenornis Services Ltd\nReport no. ZS-RI-2026-2987\nPrinted on 16/08/2026\nPage 3/3\nTechnician's opinion\nQuick couplings were dismantled, cleaned and refitted with a compatible lubricant. The customer was briefed on the\npoints of attention noted during the visit. Tests were run until readings were stable. The equipment runs on two shifts,\nfive days a week, for liquid product packaging. Emergency stops were tested and work correctly.\nApproval workflow\nThe electrical cabinet ventilation was dusted and its filter checked. Machine safety labels are legible and complete. The\nreport was reviewed on 11 August 2026. Production data from recent weeks was reviewed with the customer.\n4. Parts\nPart no.\nDescription\nAction\nUnit price\nOS-506-E\ntip cone\ninspected, kept\n27.89 €\nOS-668-E\npiston O-ring\nordered (not fitted)\n340.92 €\nOS-855-B\ntip ejector\nquoted\n447.39 €\n5. Observations\nNote, part reference of the replaced part: OS-855-K.\nAdditional information, flow rate as left: 40 mL/min.\nFor the record, status: Compliant.\nThe upstream conveyor Calzor C87 (flow 93 mL/min, pressure 1.6 bar) is outside the scope of this visit; the workshop air\nnetwork runs at 6.0 bar.\nOn arrival the equipment was rated non-compliant.\nNext preventive visit: 05/08/2027.\n6. Conclusion\nTechnician:\nCustomer approval: Erin Pryce\nValidation date : 15/08/2026\n\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /travail && cat /tmp/llm_out/doc-045.json; echo; .venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nimport pymupdf as fitz\nfor i,p in enumerate(fitz.open('fourni/doc-045.pdf')):\n print('---page',i+1); print(p.get_text())\nEOF","time":{"start":1795128093011,"end":1795128093104}},"id":"prt_1f5f8e84e001h9PscfNc09naF0","sessionID":"ses_e0a0e9139ffeueffAzFzUVtP7e","messageID":"msg_1f5f8d5c3001MeXhv5YJ7TSeMq"}}
